<title>INDIA: India's RBI cuts bank rate to 11 percent from 12.</title>
<headline>India's RBI cuts bank rate to 11 percent from 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India on Tuesday said it lowered the bank rate to 11 percent from the current 12 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said in its six-monthly credit policy the new rate would be effective from the close of business on April 15.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
